WEBVTT

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.280
Hey, is she the one?

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.680
Yeah...

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:23.150
She was lost in the woods about 6 months ago, right?

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.450
It seems so.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.290
If she was in the woods, could the thing in her belly be...

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.090
Yeah.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.860
It just might.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.800
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.770
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.270
<i>You are my star</i>

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:46.780
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:52.580
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:56.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.630
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.930
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:17.470
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:24.610
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:30.090
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.520
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:39.460
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.730
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:45.800
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.300
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:52.840
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:58.650
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:01.550
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.460
Do you feel it, Catherine?

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:16.160
Yes, Ms. Maria.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.330
It's coming from Glast Heim, isn't it?

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:22.740
Yes. I sense colossal waves of darkness spreading.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:25.540
What on earth is happening?

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:26.880
I don't know.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:30.480
But this is the first time this has happened.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:33.000
I have a bad feeling about it.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.140
Jirtas...

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:55.700
Master Dark Lord...

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:59.170
When you are resurrected, please grant me...

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.970
Grant me my wish.

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:06.210
Jirtas...

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:10.320
You, into whom is woven two destinies,

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.490
What is your wish?

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:15.790
I wish...

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:21.460
I wish for revenge against those who hated and banished me.

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.330
Punish in blood those cowards who retreated into their shells,

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:28.200
refusing to accept an outsider.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.540
And keep me at your side, Master.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:38.250
Jirtas, you are the result of mixing Monster and Human blood.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:44.520
Your wish shall be granted when I am resurrected.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.350
Thank you, my Lord.

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.690
Why are you sneaking around like this?

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.500
Bastard!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.870
You're too late.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:03.960
The Dark Lord has granted my wish.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.970
What's so funny?!

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.020
I care nothing about your wish.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:24.290
I have no interest in the wishes of someone who can only run from her true self.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.890
Wh-What?!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.430
But never forget this.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:34.200
For your wish to be granted, requires souls of those who have lost their love.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.670
Let go! Bastard!

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:41.740
I always carry out my orders.

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.750
Rest assured.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:49.340
But it is not for your sake.
It is for my own.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.360
I'm not running away!

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.980
Roan, wait! Don't walk so far ahead!

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.690
You're too slow! Hurry up!

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:28.490
You don't have to talk like that...

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.320
Right, Judia-<i>san</i>?

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:36.400
There's a stone over there.
Don't trip on it.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:40.200
The ground's slippery, too.
Be careful.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.540
Judia-<i>san</i>!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.310
Huh? What? Oh, it's probably okay.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.000
Right, Iruga?

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:51.710
Poring!

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.450
Thanks. I'm okay.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:57.390
I can't be laid up here and now.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:00.990
For Alice-<i>chan</i> s' sake,
I've got to keep going.

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:02.890
Poring!

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:04.950
In just a short while, we'll reach Comodo.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:10.970
Poring! Poring!

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:16.970
I wonder why we're traveling together...

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:20.640
People have their own goals.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.880
When their interests coincide, they travel the same path.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.210
Keough?!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:31.150
When your goals are far apart, and even your hearts are distant,

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:33.990
traveling together only brings unhappiness.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:34.960
Big Brother!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.890
You, again. Wretch.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:40.860
Our goals are one!

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:41.990
Roan!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.300
Ohh? Try asking her, then.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.870
If you two are truly one.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.000
What?!

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.340
Yuufa!

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.920
Roan, you brought this on yourself.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.790
Because you sought only to gain strength,

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:07.590
my sister has fallen into despair and sadness.

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:11.690
She should not have protected you back then.

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:13.090
Silence!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:17.900
I seek strength!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:20.200
To protect Yuufa!

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:22.640
From the likes of you!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.150
But that sentiment,

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.020
if not understood by the other, is useless!

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.980
If your hearts are apart,

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:39.720
traveling together will only bring unhappiness!

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:40.980
You dare...

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:49.990
Roan, watch out!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.970
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:01.080
Roan! Don't listen to his nonsense!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.950
But that is the correct way to see things!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:04.950
What?!

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:07.110
Be not troubled, my friend.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:10.610
You and I are one in heart.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.290
That ain't so!

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:19.950
Iruga is one in heart with me!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:25.290
Well, never mind.
Your journey has ended!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.310
No, Big Brother Iruga! Huh?

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:51.650
Venom...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.660
Splasher!

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.270
You'll die in ten seconds.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:09.940
<i>Big Brother Iruga? Using poison?</i>

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.630
What's so funny?!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.970
Poring! Poring!

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:45.970
Poring... Poring...

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.720
Poi-Poi...

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.310
Where is everybody?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.430
Poring!

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:01.660
Thanks. I'm okay.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.490
I wonder where everybody went?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.210
What're you doing here?!

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:21.340
Poring!

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:26.090
Oh, my. Don't be so mad.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:29.860
We're comrades who were both abandoned by Humans, right?

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:32.630
What do you want?

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:35.360
You're looking much better. I'm glad.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:40.100
It's no fun killing an ailing mouse.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:43.740
But first, tell me...

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.970
How can you survive by yourself?

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.340
Huh?

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:50.040
Poring!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.650
Big Brother!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:13.660
Big Brother, you're here, aren't you?

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:26.010
Big Brother Keough...

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:46.030
Judia...

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:49.940
Are you all right?

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:52.510
Yes. Not a scratch on me.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.030
Oh.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:00.080
Wait...

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:03.880
Stay like this for a while longer.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:08.650
You're mine. I won't let anybody else have you.

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:21.660
<i>Dammit.</i>

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.480
This way's blocked, too!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.540
Okay...

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.670
Holy... Cross!

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.350
Magnum...

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:41.850
...Break!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.370
They didn't work!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.360
Of course not.

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.870
It hurts to watch you.

00:12:57.870 --> 00:13:00.110
Those methods won't get the rock broken.

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:01.470
What?!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:15.460
I'll ask you once more.
How can you survive all alone?

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:20.660
When humans have despised and rejected you...

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.100
What's your support that keeps you going?

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:31.510
Humans put away everyone who is different from them.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:35.340
In a mean, cowardly way...

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:49.020
Just because I had Monster blood in me...

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.690
Huh?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.000
Take that!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.690
Stop it! Stop it!

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:04.300
Hey! You kids!

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.610
What're you doing?

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:12.580
Um...

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:14.980
--We were...
--Gimme that!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:17.920
Take better aim.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:18.980
Huh?

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.320
Take that!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.660
Stop it!

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.330
Jirtas!

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:29.650
Stop, Jirtas! Stop it!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.660
Traitor!

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.830
Getting friendly with a Monster!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.670
Get out of the village!

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.880
Crap!

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:53.480
Jirtas...

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:55.680
I'm home.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:00.420
Welcome home, Mother.

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:05.290
I got some fish today.
Shall I make some soup?

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.310
Now, let's eat.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:28.970
It's all right. You eat it.

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:34.860
Why?

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:35.820
Huh?

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.530
Why did you give birth to me?

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:42.730
If you hadn't, they wouldn't have kicked you out of the village...

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.330
You'll understand someday.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.300
Huh?

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:50.670
The time will come when you'll understand.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:00.650
But I never understood.

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:05.950
That's why I left the Human world for the world of Monsters.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.840
Is that all you've got to say?!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:28.780
What?!

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:33.250
For all your big talk, you only ran away because you couldn't take it!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.650
It's all excuses!

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:39.420
Human, Monster... it doesn't matter.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:43.420
Some are sneaks, and some have kind hearts.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:46.630
Besides, I have Poi-poi.

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.600
I'm not alone, at all!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:50.000
Poring!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.600
Dammit!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.040
Crud!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:58.670
Didn't I tell you, that won't work?

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:01.410
You can't use brute strength to break those rocks.

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.110
Then what am I supposed to do?!

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.610
We're gonna end up suffocating to death!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:10.350
Geez, and I wanted to go gambling and enjoy myself in Comodo, too.

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:13.450
Hup. And, of all things, I'm stuck in here with a spoiled little boy.

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.950
What?!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:21.800
Pushing with physical strength won't work.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:25.930
Anyhow, you're in the way, so stay there and watch.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:27.300
What's the big idea-

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.980
Big Brother Keough...

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:50.460
Come, Yuufa.

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:51.830
Huh?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:55.160
You and I share the same wish.

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.730
Wish?

00:18:56.730 --> 00:19:01.500
That's right. We both wish to build a peaceful world with no fighting.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.270
Isn't that right?

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:08.380
Then come with me.
Our hearts are one.

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:10.580
We're going to build a world of peace.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.610
Big Brother...

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.350
Yuufa...

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:16.940
I need you!

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:24.120
Crud!

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:28.160
I know how your mother felt!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:31.470
She wanted to bridge the gap between Monsters and Humans!

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:33.930
Like Alice-<i>chan</i> and me!

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:35.840
It doesn't matter if you're a Monster or Human!

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:37.240
What matters is heart!

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.640
Shut up!

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:44.800
What'll I do with her?

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:59.530
Big deal! Was it just for show?!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.360
We'll see about that.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.330
Huh?

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:16.940
The important thing isn't strength.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.280
It's a heart that seeks.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.610
A heart that seeks?

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:24.020
Right. Everyone seeks something.

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:27.720
Once you know what it is, the path will open by itself.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.590
First, you must feel what the other person wants.

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:31.990
Feel?

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:36.690
Those who rely on strength alone are someday crushed by it.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.970
Hold it!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:44.370
Your path is that way.

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:50.180
But isn't Comodo the other way?

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.370
Just go, will you?!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:08.300
You understand, too, don't you?
What your mother felt!

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:11.300
You're the only one who doesn't understand!

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:12.660
Damn!

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:20.670
Alice-<i>chan...</i>

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:22.340
Poring!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:23.670
Thank you.

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:28.980
Damn....

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:32.350
What's her problem, anyway?

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:37.420
Yuufa!

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:39.360
Come, Yuufa.

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:43.360
Come with me.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:44.700
<i>Big Brother...</i>

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:48.040
Yuufa...

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:50.030
Yuufa!

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:55.030
Yuufa, I'll be waiting.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:58.310
Yuufa!

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.180
Yuufa, are you all right?!

00:22:00.180 --> 00:22:03.920
Roan... Wh-What do you mean?

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:06.550
What? Right in front of you was...

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:07.550
Tell me, Roan...

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.260
Huh?

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:11.260
What are we to each other?

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:17.320
Huh? W-We're just childhood friends, aren't we?

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:23.670
Y-You're right.
We're just childhood friends...

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way to</i> <i>regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:32.740
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:38.710
<i>I am Defaulte.</i>
<i>The time again is short.</i>

00:23:38.710 --> 00:23:42.550
<i>Next time,</i> "Who's the Lonely One?"

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:45.520
<i>Who is it, I wonder?</i>
